---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Docs — Tempo"
  description="Documentation for Tempo: per-source integration guides, reference pages, and the upcoming Tempo user guide."
>
  <header class="page-header">
    <nav class="page-nav">
      <a href="/">← tempoapp.app</a>
    </nav>
    <h1>Documentation</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Tempo's docs split into three areas. Per-source integration guides
      live on each score's own page in the catalogue, alongside the
      download. Cross-source reference pages live here. A full Tempo user
      guide will land here once v1 ships and the rough edges are polished.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main class="doc">

    <section class="group">
      <h2>Per-source integration guides</h2>
      <p>
        For setting up a specific source — Home Assistant, Kopia, Uptime
        Kuma, UniFi, GitHub Actions, Synology, Pi-hole, Proxmox, Hazel,
        Jellyfin, Vaultwarden, and more — open the score's catalogue page.
        Each one documents the source-side configuration, the payload
        contract Tempo expects, and what the bundled severity rules and
        actions look for.
      </p>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">
          <a href="/scores">
            <h3>Browse the scores catalogue →</h3>
            <p>
              Bundled and community scores. Double-click a
              <code>.tempo-score</code> to install, or read the page for
              the integration walkthrough.
            </p>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="group">
      <h2>Reference</h2>
      <ul class="cards">
        <li class="card">
          <a href="/scores/troubleshooting-networking">
            <h3>Troubleshooting networking</h3>
            <p>
              When the score is installed and the source is configured,
              but events never reach Tempo. Five patterns that cover
              almost every reported case: firewall, Little Snitch, VLAN
              isolation, hostname resolution, port collision.
            </p>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="group">
      <h2>Tempo user guide</h2>
      <div class="placeholder">
        <p>
          <strong>Coming with v1.</strong> The app's UI is in active polish
          ahead of the first public release. Once the ship version is out
          and stable, a proper user guide lands here — covering the
          timeline, the panels, the score editor, the settings tabs, and
          the keyboard shortcuts.
        </p>
        <p>
          In the meantime, the homepage <a href="/#story">story</a> and
          <a href="/#faq">FAQ</a> sections cover most of the questions
          people ask before downloading.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="group">
      <h2>Got stuck?</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:hello@tempoapp.app">hello@tempoapp.app</a>.
        A community Discord and a public issue tracker open with the v1
        release; both will be linked here and on the homepage when they
        go live.
      </p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .page-header {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 48px auto 24px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .page-nav {
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    .page-nav a {
      color: var(--blue);
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .page-header h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .lede {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: var(--bg2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .doc {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto 80px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      line-height: 1.65;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .doc .group {
      margin-top: 48px;
    }
    .doc h2 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: var(--text);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .doc p {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .doc a {
      color: var(--blue);
    }
    .cards {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 16px 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--bg2);
      transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .card:hover {
      border-color: var(--blue);
    }
    .card a {
      display: block;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 17px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--text2);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .placeholder {
      border: 1px dashed var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 16px 20px;
      background: var(--bg2);
      color: var(--text2);
    }
    .placeholder p {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }
    .placeholder p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }
    .placeholder strong {
      color: var(--text);
    }
    .placeholder a {
      color: var(--blue);
    }
    code {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9em;
      background: var(--bg2);
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      color: var(--text);
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
